1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,003
Sona 60 din mein 24.6 percent gira.

2
00:00:03,003 --> 00:00:05,577
1982 ke baad sabse bura daur.

3
00:00:05,577 --> 00:00:08,283
Lekin sona toh safe tha? Chandi aur buri giri.

4
00:00:08,283 --> 00:00:10,387
Hafte bhar mein 15 percent se zyada.

5
00:00:10,387 --> 00:00:13,701
Aapke gehne. Aapka gold loan. Aapka gold fund.

6
00:00:13,701 --> 00:00:17,844
Sab ki keemat hili. Galti kahan hoti hai, aaj samjhiye.

7
00:00:17,844 --> 00:00:21,164
Sabse safe cheez pehle kyun bikti? Jawab aakhir mein.

8
00:00:21,164 --> 00:00:23,746
Aur woh wajah, jo koi nahi batata.

9
00:00:23,746 --> 00:00:27,621
Aaj 3 sawaal. Pehla, sona aur chandi kitna gire? Doosra,

10
00:00:27,621 --> 00:00:29,946
achanak kyun gire? Teesra, aapke gehne,

11
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:33,434
gold loan aur gold fund ka ab kya hoga?

12
00:00:33,434 --> 00:00:34,636
Pehle bhaav ki baat.

13
00:00:34,636 --> 00:00:37,340
Duniya mein sone ka bhaav dollar mein lagta hai,

14
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,842
har ounce ke hisaab se.

15
00:00:38,842 --> 00:00:41,846
Ounce yaani sona tolne ka international paimana, hamare tole jaisa.

16
00:00:41,846 --> 00:00:44,958
Mahinon tak yeh bhaav 3,500 dollar ke upar tika raha.

17
00:00:44,958 --> 00:00:47,136
Log ise mazboot deewar maante the. Socha,

18
00:00:47,136 --> 00:00:48,692
ab isse neeche kya jaayega.

19
00:00:48,692 --> 00:00:50,870
Phir isi November woh deewar toot gayi.

20
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:54,011
Ek din ke andar sona tezi se phisla. Itna neeche,

21
00:00:54,011 --> 00:00:56,839
jitna pichhle 15 mahine mein kabhi nahi gaya tha.

22
00:00:56,839 --> 00:00:59,980
Bazaar bechain ho gaya. Lekin yeh girawat achanak nahi thi.

23
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:01,224
India mein bhi jhatka pahuncha.

24
00:01:01,224 --> 00:01:04,211
Hamare yahan sone ka daam isi duniya ke bhaav se judta hai.

25
00:01:04,211 --> 00:01:04,958
Wahan bhaav gira,

26
00:01:04,958 --> 00:01:07,198
to Zaveri Bazaar ki dukaanon tak asar aata hai.

27
00:01:07,198 --> 00:01:08,450
Ab ek parivaar socho.

28
00:01:08,450 --> 00:01:11,581
Beti ki shaadi ke liye kuch hafte pehle gehne khareede.

29
00:01:11,581 --> 00:01:14,086
Unchi keemat par. Aaj wahi gehne tole jaayein,

30
00:01:14,086 --> 00:01:16,277
to unka mol pehle se kam niklega.

31
00:01:16,277 --> 00:01:17,928
Par unhone kuch anokha nahi kiya.

32
00:01:17,928 --> 00:01:20,404
Mahinon se sona lagaataar chadh raha tha. Ek lambi,

33
00:01:20,404 --> 00:01:23,155
zordaar tezi chal rahi thi. Har taraf yahi baat thi,

34
00:01:23,155 --> 00:01:24,256
sona aur upar jaayega.

35
00:01:24,256 --> 00:01:26,034
Yahin sabse badi galatfehmi chhupi hai.

36
00:01:26,034 --> 00:01:28,702
Log 'safe' ka matlab samajhte hain, 'kabhi nahi girega'.

37
00:01:28,702 --> 00:01:29,887
Par bazaar ne dikhaya,

38
00:01:29,887 --> 00:01:32,258
safe cheez bhi tezi se gir sakti hai.

39
00:01:32,258 --> 00:01:34,098
Toh itni bikri aayi kahan se?

40
00:01:34,098 --> 00:01:37,470
Gali ke chhote khareedar se nahi. Duniya ke bade bazaaron se,

41
00:01:37,470 --> 00:01:40,230
jahan ek din mein bahut bada maal bikta hai.

42
00:01:40,230 --> 00:01:41,752
Aur asli sawaal yeh hai.

43
00:01:41,752 --> 00:01:45,099
Itni lambi tezi ko achanak brake kisne lagaya? Jawab samundar paar,

44
00:01:45,099 --> 00:01:47,229
America ke kuch aankdon mein chhupa hai.

45
00:01:47,229 --> 00:01:49,341
Doosra sawaal: sona achanak kyun gira?

46
00:01:49,341 --> 00:01:53,212
Is baar 3 dhakke ek saath lage. Mehngai, byaaj aur dollar.

47
00:01:53,212 --> 00:01:56,732
Ek ek karke samjhiye, kyunki yeh aapas mein jude hain.

48
00:01:56,732 --> 00:01:57,719
Pehla dhakka, mehngai.

49
00:01:57,719 --> 00:02:01,009
America mein mehngai ke naye aankde umeed se garam aaye.

50
00:02:01,009 --> 00:02:05,616
Matlab wahan roz ki cheezein andaaze se zyada tezi se mehngi ho rahi thi.

51
00:02:05,616 --> 00:02:09,045
Ab America ka central bank, jo wahan byaaj tay karta hai,

52
00:02:09,045 --> 00:02:11,850
mehngai se ladta hai. Kaise? Byaaj ooncha rakh kar.

53
00:02:11,850 --> 00:02:14,655
Bazaar ko laga, byaaj ab jaldi kam nahi hoga.

54
00:02:14,655 --> 00:02:17,496
Doosra dhakka, byaaj. Yahan ek seedhi baat samjho.

55
00:02:17,496 --> 00:02:19,271
Sona koi byaaj nahi deta.

56
00:02:19,271 --> 00:02:23,177
Woh tijori mein chupchaap pada rehta hai. Na kiraya, na munafa,

57
00:02:23,177 --> 00:02:24,597
bas bhaav ka khel.

58
00:02:24,597 --> 00:02:27,838
Ek misaal lijiye. Ek dukaan har mahine kiraya deti hai.

59
00:02:27,838 --> 00:02:30,754
Doosri khaali padi hai, koi kiraya nahi. Byaaj badhe,

60
00:02:30,754 --> 00:02:33,347
to log kiraye wali dukaan pasand karte hain.

61
00:02:33,347 --> 00:02:34,967
Sona woh khaali dukaan hai.

62
00:02:34,967 --> 00:02:38,017
Jab bank ki FD aur sarkari bond achha byaaj dene lagte hain,

63
00:02:38,017 --> 00:02:39,542
tab sona rakhna mehnga lagta hai.

64
00:02:39,542 --> 00:02:42,592
Bade fund sona bech kar byaaj wali cheezon mein paisa daalte hain.

65
00:02:42,592 --> 00:02:43,537
Teesra dhakka, dollar.

66
00:02:43,537 --> 00:02:47,318
Mehngai aur oonche byaaj ki umeed ne dollar ko phir mazboot kiya.

67
00:02:47,318 --> 00:02:50,783
Aur yaad rakhiye, sone ka bhaav dollar mein hi lagta hai.

68
00:02:50,783 --> 00:02:51,745
Dollar mehnga hua,

69
00:02:51,745 --> 00:02:55,274
to baaki deshon ke liye sona mehnga ho gaya. Europe, Japan,

70
00:02:55,274 --> 00:02:58,161
India ka khareedar thoda ruk gaya. Maang dheeli padi,

71
00:02:58,161 --> 00:02:59,444
aur bhaav neeche aaya.

72
00:02:59,444 --> 00:03:02,093
Ise jhoole ki tarah samjho. Ek taraf dollar baitha hai,

73
00:03:02,093 --> 00:03:03,947
doosri taraf sona. Dollar upar jaata hai,

74
00:03:03,947 --> 00:03:06,860
to sona aksar neeche aata hai. Is baar bhi yahi hua.

75
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:09,056
Aur ek aakhri kaaran, sabse insaani.

76
00:03:09,056 --> 00:03:11,983
Mahinon ki tezi mein jinhone pehle khareeda tha,

77
00:03:11,983 --> 00:03:14,910
unke paas bada munafa jama tha. Kaagaz par.

78
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:16,374
Abhi jeb mein nahi.

79
00:03:16,374 --> 00:03:17,601
Jaise hi hawa badli,

80
00:03:17,601 --> 00:03:20,056
unhone munafa jeb mein daalne ke liye becha.

81
00:03:20,056 --> 00:03:22,817
Ise profit-booking kehte hain. Yaani kamaai bachaane ke liye,

82
00:03:22,817 --> 00:03:24,351
tezi ke baad bech dena.

83
00:03:24,351 --> 00:03:27,631
Phir domino chala. Ek ne becha, bhaav gira. Bhaav gira,

84
00:03:27,631 --> 00:03:29,599
to doosre ghabraaye. Unhone bhi becha.

85
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:33,207
Bikri se aur bikri paida hui, aur girawat tez ho gayi.

86
00:03:33,207 --> 00:03:36,198
Par ek baat ajeeb lagti hai. Kitaab kehti hai,

87
00:03:36,198 --> 00:03:39,854
mehngai badhe to sona chadhta hai. Phir is baar mehngai badhi,

88
00:03:39,854 --> 00:03:42,180
aur sona gira. Yeh ulta kyun hua?

89
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:45,935
Kyunki is baar bazaar mehngai se kam, byaaj se zyada dara.

90
00:03:45,935 --> 00:03:47,643
Garam mehngai matlab ooncha byaaj.

91
00:03:47,643 --> 00:03:51,398
Aur ooncha byaaj sone ke liye bhaari. Wahi asli khel tha.

92
00:03:51,398 --> 00:03:53,213
Ab chandi. Kitco News ke mutabik,

93
00:03:53,213 --> 00:03:55,934
chandi hafte bhar mein 15 percent se zyada giri.

94
00:03:55,934 --> 00:03:58,656
Yeh is saal ka uska sabse bura hafta tha.

95
00:03:58,656 --> 00:03:59,866
Sone se kaafi tez.

96
00:03:59,866 --> 00:04:03,449
Kyun? Pehli wajah, chandi ka bazaar sone se kaafi chhota hai.

97
00:04:03,449 --> 00:04:06,706
Chhote talaab mein ek pathar bhi badi lehar uthata hai.

98
00:04:06,706 --> 00:04:08,334
Thodi bikri, aur bada jhatka.

99
00:04:08,334 --> 00:04:10,914
Doosri wajah, chandi sirf gehna nahi. Solar panel,

100
00:04:10,914 --> 00:04:13,817
electronics aur factory ke kaam mein bhi lagti hai.

101
00:04:13,817 --> 00:04:16,397
Isliye uska bhaav kai taraf se hilta hai.

102
00:04:16,397 --> 00:04:19,746
Matlab chandi sone ki chhoti behen jaisi hai. Saath chalti hai,

103
00:04:19,746 --> 00:04:22,790
par zyada chanchal. Tezi mein sone se tez bhaagti hai.

104
00:04:22,790 --> 00:04:25,226
Aur girawat mein, usse bhi tez girti hai.

105
00:04:25,226 --> 00:04:27,009
Kai gharon mein chandi ke sikke,

106
00:04:27,009 --> 00:04:29,387
payal aur bartan jama karne ka riwaaz hai.

107
00:04:29,387 --> 00:04:32,656
Jinhone tezi ke top par 'sasta sona' samajh kar chandi li,

108
00:04:32,656 --> 00:04:34,142
unhe sabse tez jhatka laga.

109
00:04:34,142 --> 00:04:37,202
Ab bada sawaal. Kya aisi girawat pehle bhi aayi hai?

110
00:04:37,202 --> 00:04:40,568
Ya yeh pehli baar hai? Itihaas ka jawab seedha hai. Haan,

111
00:04:40,568 --> 00:04:42,404
aayi hai. Aur lambi bhi chali.

112
00:04:42,404 --> 00:04:44,862
2013 ko yaad kijiye. BullionVault ke mutabik,

113
00:04:44,862 --> 00:04:48,374
us poore saal mein sona dollar mein 30 percent gira.

114
00:04:48,374 --> 00:04:51,534
Yaani lagbhag ek tihaai keemat, saal bhar mein saaf.

115
00:04:51,534 --> 00:04:53,083
Tab bhi kahani milti-julti thi.

116
00:04:53,083 --> 00:04:56,800
America ke central bank ne paise ki neeti modne ke sanket diye.

117
00:04:56,800 --> 00:05:00,207
Sasta paisa band hone ki baat aayi, aur sona bikne laga.

118
00:05:00,207 --> 00:05:03,548
2013 ka sabak saaf tha. Jise duniya 'safe' kehti hai,

119
00:05:03,548 --> 00:05:07,223
woh bhi lambi girawat dekh sakta hai. Hafton nahi, mahinon tak.

120
00:05:07,223 --> 00:05:09,228
Jab paise ki neeti mudti hai.

121
00:05:09,228 --> 00:05:11,425
Us waqt jinhone ghabra kar neeche becha,

122
00:05:11,425 --> 00:05:14,249
unhone kaagazi nuksaan ko asli bana diya. Jo ruke,

123
00:05:14,249 --> 00:05:17,387
unhe intezaar karna pada. Aur woh intezaar chhota nahi tha.

124
00:05:17,387 --> 00:05:18,535
Yaani sona tootta nahi,

125
00:05:18,535 --> 00:05:20,830
par kabhi kabhi lambi neend so jaata hai.

126
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:23,413
Yeh baat jewellery ki dukaan par koi nahi batata.

127
00:05:23,413 --> 00:05:25,708
Wahan sirf tezi ki kahaniyan sunaai jaati hain.

128
00:05:25,708 --> 00:05:27,659
Par ek paheli ab bhi baaki hai.

129
00:05:27,659 --> 00:05:29,332
Dar ke waqt sona chadhna chahiye.

130
00:05:29,332 --> 00:05:31,005
Phir bade jhatke ke pehle din,

131
00:05:31,005 --> 00:05:34,071
sabse pehle sona hi kyun bikta hai? Jawab chaunkaane wala hai.

132
00:05:34,071 --> 00:05:35,543
Sona 'safe' kaha jaata hai.

133
00:05:35,543 --> 00:05:38,488
Phir sona sirf 60 din mein 24.6 percent kyun gira?

134
00:05:38,488 --> 00:05:42,021
Yeh sawaal aaj sona rakhne wale har parivaar ke mann mein hai.

135
00:05:42,021 --> 00:05:43,860
Commodity analyst Lukas Kuemmerle ke mutabik,

136
00:05:43,860 --> 00:05:47,539
60 din mein itni badi girawat 1982 ke baad nahi aayi thi.

137
00:05:47,539 --> 00:05:49,685
Matlab aapke Papa ki jawani ke baad,

138
00:05:49,685 --> 00:05:51,218
aisa daur nahi dekha gaya.

139
00:05:51,218 --> 00:05:53,694
Toh asli wajah kya hai? Ek kadwi sachchai.

140
00:05:53,694 --> 00:05:57,100
Duniya ke bade fund aksar udhaar ka paisa lekar shares aur

141
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:59,576
doosri cheezon par bahut bada daav lagaate hain.

142
00:05:59,576 --> 00:06:01,812
Jab bazaar mein achanak jhatka lagta hai,

143
00:06:01,812 --> 00:06:04,366
to udhaar dene wala turant paisa maangta hai.

144
00:06:04,366 --> 00:06:07,560
Ise margin call kehte hain. Yaani 'abhi paisa jama karo,

145
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,518
warna saude band'.

146
00:06:08,518 --> 00:06:11,710
Ab fund kya beche? Gire hue share beche, to bada nuksaan.

147
00:06:11,710 --> 00:06:13,451
Kuch cheezein turant bikti hi nahi.

148
00:06:13,451 --> 00:06:15,772
Toh woh woh cheez bechta hai jo foran,

149
00:06:15,772 --> 00:06:17,223
achhe daam par bik jaaye.

150
00:06:17,223 --> 00:06:18,581
Woh cheez hai sona.

151
00:06:18,581 --> 00:06:21,296
Duniya ka sabse aasaani se bikne wala maal.

152
00:06:21,296 --> 00:06:23,672
Isliye bade dar ke pehle jhatke mein,

153
00:06:23,672 --> 00:06:26,388
sona aksar sabse pehle bikta hai. Majboori mein.

154
00:06:26,388 --> 00:06:29,282
Matlab sona is liye nahi gira ki woh bekaar ho gaya.

155
00:06:29,282 --> 00:06:31,912
Woh is liye bika kyunki woh sabse kaam ka tha.

156
00:06:31,912 --> 00:06:34,017
Sabse bharosemand, aur sabse jaldi paisa dene wala.

157
00:06:34,017 --> 00:06:36,721
Toh agli baar sona achanak gire, to yeh yaad rakhna.

158
00:06:36,721 --> 00:06:38,343
Har girawat kamzori ka sabut nahi.

159
00:06:38,343 --> 00:06:41,858
Kabhi kabhi yeh bas kisi aur ka nuksaan bharne ki bikri hoti hai.

160
00:06:41,858 --> 00:06:45,347
Teesra sawaal, aur sabse zaroori. Aapke paise ka ab kya?

161
00:06:45,347 --> 00:06:48,837
Har tarah ke sone wale par asar alag hai. Gehne,

162
00:06:48,837 --> 00:06:51,628
gold loan, gold fund aur sarkari gold bond.

163
00:06:51,628 --> 00:06:54,325
Pehle gehne wale. Agar tezi ke waqt gehne liye,

164
00:06:54,325 --> 00:06:56,123
to aaj unka mol kam dikhega.

165
00:06:56,123 --> 00:06:58,220
Par gehne aksar bechne ke liye nahi,

166
00:06:58,220 --> 00:07:00,318
pehenne aur sambhaalne ke liye hote hain.

167
00:07:00,318 --> 00:07:03,635
Ek baat yaad rakhiye. Gehne par making charge lagta hai,

168
00:07:03,635 --> 00:07:07,284
yaani banwaai ka kharcha. Bechte waqt yeh aksar wapas nahi milta.

169
00:07:07,284 --> 00:07:09,606
Isliye gehna investment kam, shauk zyada hai.

170
00:07:09,606 --> 00:07:10,707
Doosre, gold loan wale.

171
00:07:10,707 --> 00:07:13,183
Aapne sona girvi rakh kar bank se loan liya.

172
00:07:13,183 --> 00:07:16,209
Girvi yaani loan ke badle sona bank ke paas jama rakhna.

173
00:07:16,209 --> 00:07:19,236
Bank sone ke bhaav ke hisaab se hi loan deta hai.

174
00:07:19,236 --> 00:07:20,040
Ab bhaav gira,

175
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:23,525
to bank ki nazar mein aapka girvi sona kam keemat ka ho gaya.

176
00:07:23,525 --> 00:07:27,278
Aise mein bank thoda paisa lautane ya aur sona rakhne ko keh sakta hai.

177
00:07:27,278 --> 00:07:31,397
Isliye gold loan wale apne bank ke message aur shartein dhyaan se padhein.

178
00:07:31,397 --> 00:07:34,248
Ghabraahat mein nahi, poori baat samajh kar kadam uthayein.

179
00:07:34,248 --> 00:07:35,832
Yahi sabse sasta bachaav hai.

180
00:07:35,832 --> 00:07:37,048
Teesre, gold ETF wale.

181
00:07:37,048 --> 00:07:39,783
ETF yaani share bazaar ke raaste khareeda gaya sona,

182
00:07:39,783 --> 00:07:42,214
bina tijori aur bina chori ke darr ke.

183
00:07:42,214 --> 00:07:44,645
Iska bhaav roz sone ke saath chalta hai.

184
00:07:44,645 --> 00:07:46,753
Toh sona gira, to aapka ETF bhi gira.

185
00:07:46,753 --> 00:07:48,335
Yeh fund ki galti nahi hai.

186
00:07:48,335 --> 00:07:50,707
Fund wahi kar raha hai jo usse karna tha.

187
00:07:50,707 --> 00:07:52,288
Sone ki parchhai ki tarah chalna.

188
00:07:52,288 --> 00:07:54,930
Chauthe, SGB wale. SGB yaani Sovereign Gold Bond,

189
00:07:54,930 --> 00:07:56,252
sarkar ka gold bond.

190
00:07:56,252 --> 00:07:59,555
Iski keemat bhi sone ke saath upar neeche hoti hai.

191
00:07:59,555 --> 00:08:01,206
Lekin isme ek fark hai.

192
00:08:01,206 --> 00:08:05,046
SGB sone ke bhaav ke upar har saal 2.5 percent byaaj bhi deta hai.

193
00:08:05,046 --> 00:08:07,789
Bhaav gire, tab bhi yeh chhota byaaj aata rehta hai.

194
00:08:07,789 --> 00:08:09,435
Girawat mein yeh thoda sahara hai.

195
00:08:09,435 --> 00:08:11,643
Ab sabse badi galti, top par.

196
00:08:11,643 --> 00:08:14,954
Jab har jagah 'sona record par' ki baat ho,

197
00:08:14,954 --> 00:08:17,898
tabhi zyadatar log daudte hain. Bheed ke saath,

198
00:08:17,898 --> 00:08:19,370
sabse unchi keemat par.

199
00:08:19,370 --> 00:08:22,502
Aur neeche ki galti. Jab bhaav gire aur khabrein daraayein,

200
00:08:22,502 --> 00:08:25,635
wahi log ghabra kar bech dete hain. Unche mein liya,

201
00:08:25,635 --> 00:08:28,141
neeche mein becha. Kaagazi nuksaan asli ban gaya.

202
00:08:28,141 --> 00:08:30,019
Teesri galti, 'safe' ka galat matlab.

203
00:08:30,019 --> 00:08:32,524
Safe ka matlab hai lambe waqt ka sahara.

204
00:08:32,524 --> 00:08:35,341
Iska matlab yeh nahi ki bhaav kabhi nahi girega.

205
00:08:35,341 --> 00:08:36,906
2013 ne yahi sikhaya tha.

206
00:08:36,906 --> 00:08:39,169
Toh samajhdaari kya hai? Pehle khud se poochhiye,

207
00:08:39,169 --> 00:08:42,282
sona kyun rakha hai? Shaadi ke liye, mushkil waqt ke liye,

208
00:08:42,282 --> 00:08:45,394
ya jaldi munafe ke liye? Jawab se hi soch badalti hai.

209
00:08:45,394 --> 00:08:48,544
Jo log sona thoda thoda, alag alag waqt par lete hain,

210
00:08:48,544 --> 00:08:50,549
unhe top ka dar kam rehta hai.

211
00:08:50,549 --> 00:08:53,127
Aur khabar ki garmi mein jaldbaazi bhaari padti hai.

212
00:08:53,127 --> 00:08:54,559
Yeh investment advice nahi hai.

213
00:08:54,559 --> 00:08:58,288
Ab shuru ka sawaal. Sabse safe cheez sabse pehle kyun biki?

214
00:08:58,288 --> 00:09:01,678
Kyunki dar ke waqt duniya ko turant paisa chahiye tha.

215
00:09:01,678 --> 00:09:03,712
Aur sona sabse turant bikta hai.

216
00:09:03,712 --> 00:09:06,361
Agle video mein, gold loan ki shartein, aasaan bhasha mein.

217
00:09:06,361 --> 00:09:08,215
Aur yeh video us dost ko bhejo,

218
00:09:08,215 --> 00:09:10,069
jo kehta hai sona kabhi nahi girta.

219
00:09:10,069 --> 00:09:12,322
Ab aapse ek aasaan sawaal.

220
00:09:12,322 --> 00:09:16,828
Aapke ghar mein sona kis liye hai: shaadi, mushkil waqt,

221
00:09:16,828 --> 00:09:20,433
ya munafa? Comment mein bas ek shabd likhiye.
